From b792dcd351f776ed504c01101f682aaf33a9daa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:40:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ProseOthello 0.1-2: the board is the window
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The side panel is gone (white space nobody asked for): the board fills
the window below the menu bar, and the title carries the score, the
turn and the state -- "ProseOthello -- 3…3 -- your move (4)" -- the
way ProsePaint's status does. ProseJulia moves to 0.1-3 (rebuilt).

Prose-Patch: 0101-proseothello-0-1-2-the-board-is-the-window.patch 570fe9ee1f66d3456ae935d270e9f909524215ffa859d405a9ee86343f09b261
